E298   D0 02                  BNE   tg1   
E29A   F6 01                  INC   1,X   
E29C   60           TG1:      RTS      
E29D                             ; "[" followed by a letter stores the body"s address in that letter"s cell:
E29D                             ; uppercase is a word, lowercase a variable. Followed by a space it pushes
E29D                             ; the body"s address instead. Either way it then skips to the matching "]'.
E29D                             ; (The unchecked build takes anything that is not a letter as the space; the
E29D                             ; checked build stops on it.)
